<title>AUSTRALIA: Boral's Envestra float fully subscribed.</title>
<headline>Boral's Envestra float fully subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The A$350 million offer of stapled securities in Boral Ltd's gas distribution spinoff, Envestra Ltd, has been fully subscribed, Envestra said on Monday.</p>
<p>Each stapled security, comprising one loan note and one Envestra share, was offered at A$1.</p>
<p>Envestra said it will list on the Australian Stock Exchange next week under the code  ENV.AX.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
